"<h2>Entrance and exit losses</h2>\n"
"<p>Use the entrance term where liquid moves from a tank into the first pipe segment. Use the exit term where the last pipe segment discharges into a large tank. Each end can be included independently.</p>\n"
"<h3>Equations and SI units</h3>\n"
"<p><b>h<sub>L</sub> = K V<sup>2</sup> / (2g)</b><br/><b>Δp = ρ g h<sub>L</sub> = K ρ V<sup>2</sup> / 2</b></p>\n"
