"<p><b>Reference velocity matters.</b> Entrance uses the first segment\'s mean velocity; exit uses the last segment\'s mean velocity. In each case V = Q/A and A = πD²/4, with Q in m³/s and internal diameter D in m. Select a coefficient defined using that same velocity basis.</p>\n"
"<h3>Indicative entrance coefficients</h3>\n"
