"<h3>Exit into a large tank</h3>\n"
"<p><b>K ≈ 1.0</b> is the default for pipe discharge into a large tank, using the velocity in the last pipe segment.</p>\n"
"<p>These coefficients are starting estimates. Match the actual edge shape, rounding, projection and flow conditions to an appropriate measured or published coefficient. Culvert recommendations apply to their stated arrangements. Avoid counting a boundary loss again if it has already been included elsewhere in the model.</p>\n"
